<title>They Threatened to Arrest Me for Not Paying a Debt. Is That Legal? | Me vs. Collector</title>
<meta name="description" content="A debt collector threatening you with arrest is a federal violation under the FDCPA. Here's exactly what the law says, why they do it anyway, and how to use it against them.">
